		<lb n="1"/>kō-vicaiya ma<supplied reason="lost">yē</supplied>ntira-paruma<unclear>ṟku mu</unclear>
		<lb n="2" break="no"/>-p-patt’ iraṇṭ-āvatu		
	</p>
	
	<p>
		<gap reason="lost" quantity="4" unit="character"/>yai to
